{"ref":"BDB, יָעֵל²","hw":"יָעֵל²","html":"II. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">יָעֵל</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.f.</strong> wife of Heber the Kenite, slayer of Sisera <a data-ref=\"Judges 4:17\" href=\"/Judges.4.17\">Ju 4:17</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 4:18\" href=\"/Judges.4.18\">18</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 4:21\" href=\"/Judges.4.21\">21</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 4:22\" href=\"/Judges.4.22\">22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 5:24\" href=\"/Judges.5.24\">5:24</a>, prob. also v <a data-ref=\"Judges 5:6\" href=\"/Judges.5.6\">6</a> (others find here name of a man, a ‘judge’).","next":"BDB, יַעֲלָה","prev":"BDB, יָעֵל"}